{"data":{"body":"[P1] Wait for the statement to finish before returning. `executeStatement` only submits asynchronous work, so later SQL or permission failures are silently lost. With `ON_CHANGE`, an older RUNNING merge can also finish after the terminal merge and overwrite it. Poll `DescribeStatement` to a terminal status with a bounded timeout, surface failures, and add the required IAM action and tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7uFD0T","finding_digest":"ca6ef2a49f7cd4c80e3f1e5600a70a3102f670dece60a8620ff896830d3989d0","finding_id":"arf_v1_zjxpfje7ptkmqdr7dzlabjykge","finding_key":"insight-plugin/redshiftexporter::export::terminal-statement-ordering","identity_key":"insight-plugin/redshiftexporter::export::terminal-statement-ordering","line":114,"observation_digest":"c12d1e0d172677b9933475e6057fbff76f501859d2b0e8eb78624188410e55ca","observation_id":"aro_v1_yewr4dixez33tezuoxtak75765","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/exporters/RedshiftExporter.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_zjxpfje7ptkmqdr7dzlabjykge","published_at":"2026-09-11T23:59:22Z","review_id":"arr_v1_dsz4gv2uaenyehudpwq7ak7gfu","reviewed_base_sha":"7f1a73ca16308d31a1e5a270e504676caf890e0b","reviewed_head_sha":"31041e66099621f3132e1db1765a716c2d304296","reviewer":"codex","start_line":106,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":704},"record_id":"art_v1_uumr6qy4sjn2xwfh4o6a3f67li","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-11T23:59:22Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
